---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    A Software engineer with over half-a-decade of experience and expertise in
    React, Tailwind, Node, MySQL, Postgres, and TypeScript, combined with
    technical proficiency and business acumen to deliver efficient, scalable
    solutions and proven ability to streamline organizational processes, automate
    workflows, and collaborate across teams to achieve strategic objectives.
  </div>

  <!-- <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="BSc. Computer Science"
      subtitle="2025 to 2029 at Covenant University, Ota, Nigeria"
    />
  </div> -->

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Busha / Software Engineer"
      subtitle="May 2022 - Jan 2026, Lagos, Nigeria"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>
          Optimized and maintained the core web frontend architecture for an SEC-licensed crypto finance platform, delivering stable, bank-grade user experiences that scale to support over 1 million retail users and $3.5 billion+ in total transaction volumes.
        </li>
        <li>
          Designed and built a mobile-first, multi-step onboarding and KYC pipeline, utilizing granular input validation and robust error-handling states that minimized drop-off rates during friction-heavy compliance checks.
        </li>
        <li>
          Led the front-end execution of payment utilities, transforming complex crypto transactions into intuitive, one-click workflows for localized African markets (such as Nigeria, Kenya) features like airtime top-ups, recurring buys, and instant voucher purchases.
        </li>
        <li>
          Engineered real-time wallet balances, dynamic trading charts, and instantaneous swap screens by orchestrating tight API syncs with backend market-data engines, ensuring absolute precision and data integrity for over 7 million processed trades.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4 italic">
        Core Technologies: React, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, TypeScript
      </p>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Prunedge / Software Engineer"
      subtitle="May 2023 - July 2023, California, USA"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>
          Led the front-end architecture of a Customer Relationship Management (CRM) delivering a user-friendly and efficient platform still in active use.
        </li>
        <li>
          Developed enterprise-grade HRM software for leading banks, providing robust employee management capabilities.
        </li>
        <li>
          Provide responsive technical support via Slack, Telegram, and email to internal teams and external partners.
        </li>
        <li>
          Introduced innovative development patterns to boost team efficiency and minimise bugs.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4 italic">
        Core Technologies: React.js, TypeScript, Redux, React Query, Material-UI
      </p>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Ubiscore / Software Engineer"
      subtitle="April 2022 - January 2023, Berlin, Germany"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>
          Architected a high-performance, multi-tenant frontend infrastructure for a B2B data privacy SaaS, enabling the sales team to successfully target and close enterprise clients requiring rigid multi-organization compliance management.
        </li>
        <li>
          Designed and engineered dynamic compliance dashboards and real-time scanning interfaces that translated complex backend audit data into an intuitive "data privacy credit score." This visualization strategy directly improved user activation by making GDPR, CCPA, and LGPD risks immediately actionable for non-technical business stakeholders.
        </li>
        <li>
          Orchestrated robust, secure API integration layers and state management to handle real-time cross-origin communication during deep domain compliance scans, ensuring zero-latency data propagation and zero data leaks for high-traffic enterprise users.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4 italic">
        Core Technologies: Next.js, GraphQL, SaaS, TypeScript, React
      </p>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Turing / Frontend Software Engineer"
      subtitle="October 2022 - November 2022, Palo Alto, USA"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>
          Built intuitive configuration and deployment dashboards that allowed non-technical enterprise stakeholders to easily train, monitor, and deploy AI assistants, directly reducing customer onboarding friction and time-to-value.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4 italic">Core Technologies: React.js, TypeScript, Redux</p>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Metricks / Software Engineer"
      subtitle="October 2021 - April 2022, London, United Kingdom"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>
          Developed the frontend architecture for an end-to-end affiliate marketing platform, enabling businesses to launch and scale revenue-generating affiliate programs in under 5 minutes.
        </li>
        <li>
          Orchestrated complex integrations with global e-commerce platforms (Shopify, WooCommerce), payment gateways (Stripe, PayPal), and marketing automation tools, ensuring seamless data flow across the merchant's entire sales stack.
        </li>
        <li>
          Architected real-time reporting interfaces and performance dashboards that allowed advertisers to identify top-performing affiliates and make data-driven decisions to maximize marketing spend efficiency.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4 italic">
        Core Technologies: Next.js, TypeScript, Sanity, Tailwind CSS
      </p>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Ultimate Technologies / Web Developer"
      subtitle="October 2019 - October 2021"
    >
      <ul class="list-disc ml-4">
        <li>
          Delivered high-quality, scalable applications using the MERN (MySQL, Express, React, and Node.js) stack, meeting project timelines and exceeding stakeholder expectations.
        </li>
        <li>
          Reduced technical debt through code refactoring and implementation of best practices, resulting in improved maintainability.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4 italic">
        Core Technologies: React.js, Node.js, Express, MySQL
      </p>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Awards</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      Recognized as the "Outstanding Front-End Engineer of the Year" and honored
      with the "Values Award" for exemplifying company culture and driving
      innovation - <i
        ><a
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
          class="text-primary"
          href="https://www.busha.ng">Busha</a
        ></i
      >
    </li>
  </ul>


  <!-- 
  <div>
    <div class="mb-5">
      <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications</div>
    </div>

    <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
      <li>
        <a href="#" target="_blank"> Certification Name (with link)</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#" target="_blank"> Certification Name (with link)</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div> -->

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>React.js</li>
    <li>Next.js</li>
    <li>JavaScript</li>
    <li>TypeScript</li>
    <li>TailwindCSS</li>
    <li>Redux</li>
    <li>GraphQL</li>
    <li>Sanity</li>
    <li>Material-UI</li>
    <li>React Query</li>
    <li>Flutter</li>
    <li>Node.js</li>
    <li>Saas</li>
    <li>React Native</li>
    <li>Vue</li>
    <li>React Testing Library</li>
    <li>Vite</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5 mt-10">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Transferable Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-3 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Collaborative Problem Solving</li>
    <li>Business Savvy</li>
    <li>User-Centric Development</li>
    <li>Product Management leadership</li>
    <li>Scalability and Performance Optimization</li>
    <li>Strong attention to details</li>
    <li>Keen eye for design</li>
    <li>Fluent in English (both written and spoken)</li>
    <li>Strong communication</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
